  Specimen is inked for orientation as follows  Anterior blue  posterior black  superior green and inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal yellow lobulate adipose tissue with scant areas of dense white tan focally nodular rubbery fibrous tissue throughout with multiple cystic structures throughout  The specimen is entirely submitted sequentially from lateral to medial as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Lateral end  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Body   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Medial end  en face  Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M D   Electronically signed on Thursday August 20   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01 16 20PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  PART   Breast  Right   Excision  report_end  , Absent.
